    "### Observation\n",
    "\n",
    "The `TotalCharges` column cannot be used for numerical analysis in its current format. The blank string values must first be converted into `NaN`, after which the column can be converted to a numeric data type.\n",
    "\n",
    "Handling these hidden missing values is an essential preprocessing step before training machine learning models."
   ]
