    "### Observation\n",
    "\n",
    "The Decision Tree model achieved an accuracy of **71.86%**, which is lower than the Logistic Regression model. The model correctly classified **838 non-churn customers** and **173 churn customers**, but it also misclassified a considerable number of customers.\n",
    "\n",
    "The model's ROC-AUC score of **0.637** indicates relatively weak classification performance compared to Logistic Regression."
