   "source": [
    "### Business Insight\n",
    "\n",
    "The Decision Tree model was able to identify customer churn patterns, but its predictive performance was lower than Logistic Regression. The model showed reduced precision, recall, and ROC-AUC score, indicating that it struggled to accurately distinguish between churned and non-churned customers.\n",
    "\n",
    "Based on the current results, Logistic Regression provides more reliable predictions for customer churn than the default Decision Tree model."
