    "## 7.4 Feature Scaling (for KNN)\n",
    "\n",
    "Feature Scaling is applied before training the K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN) model because KNN is a distance-based algorithm. Standardization ensures that all numerical features contribute equally to distance calculations."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 86,
   "id": "230733d5",
   "metadata": {
