   "source": [
    "## 7.5 K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN)\n",
    "\n",
    "K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN) is a supervised machine learning algorithm that classifies a data point based on the majority class of its nearest neighbors. Since KNN is a distance-based algorithm, feature scaling is required to ensure that all features contribute equally to the distance calculation."
   ]
  },
