    "<a id=\"class-imbalance\"></a>\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "# 9. ⚖️ Handling Class Imbalance\n",
    "\n",
    "The target variable is moderately imbalanced (roughly 73% No Churn vs 27% Churn). This can bias models toward the majority class, reducing their ability to correctly identify customers who actually churn (recall on the churn class).\n",
    "\n",
    "In this section, Logistic Regression and Random Forest are retrained using `class_weight='balanced'`, which automatically re-weights classes inversely proportional to their frequency, and the results are compared against the original (unweighted) models."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 97,
